      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the conversation.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"52\">Lan: Grandma, how was family life in the past?</p>\n<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"217\">Grandma: It was very different, Lan. Families were big, and we lived in a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>17.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-17' index='0' name='fbo-907976-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-907976-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-907976-0'></option><option value=\"extended family\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907976-0-extended family'>extended family</option><option value=\"nuclear family\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907976-0-nuclear family'>nuclear family</option></select></span></strong> with grandparents, parents, and children in one <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>17.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-17' index='1' name='fbo-907976-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-907976-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-907976-1'></option><option value=\"course\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907976-1-course'>course</option><option value=\"household\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907976-1-household'>household</option></select></span></strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"279\">Lan: Was the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>17.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-17' index='2' name='fbo-907976-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-907976-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-907976-2'></option><option value=\"parents-children relation\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907976-2-parents-children relation'>parents-children relation</option><option value=\"community service\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907976-2-community service'>community service</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;strict?</p>\n<p data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"445\">Grandma: Yes, children respected their parents and obeyed them. Parents worked hard to provide for the family, and children helped with housework and farming.</p>\n<p data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"482\">Lan: Did you play a lot?</p>\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"648\">Grandma: We played simple games like marbles and kite flying, but we also had duties. Some boys even <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>17.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-17' index='3' name='fbo-907976-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-907976-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-907976-3'></option><option value=\"drove\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907976-3-drove'>drove</option><option value=\"rode\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907976-3-rode'>rode</option></select></span></strong> buffalos in the fields.</p>",
