      "questionText": "<p><strong>Drag and drop to complete the text.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"206\">Nowadays, life in Vietnam is very <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.1</label><input id='fbo-907991-0' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='0' name='fbo-907991-0' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907991-0' /></span></strong> from the past. Young people have a better chance to learn with modern schools, online resources, and <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.2</label><input id='fbo-907991-1' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='1' name='fbo-907991-1' type='text' size='23' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907991-1' /></span></strong> for their future careers.</p>\n<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"423\">Many teenagers are less <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.3</label><input id='fbo-907991-2' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='2' name='fbo-907991-2' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907991-2' /></span></strong> on parents and make their own decisions about education and lifestyle. Some express themselves by the way they choose their own clothes or even <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.4</label><input id='fbo-907991-3' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='3' name='fbo-907991-3' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907991-3' /></span></strong> their hair in bright colors.</p>\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"711\" data-is-last-node>Despite these changes, Vietnamese culture still reflects&nbsp;strong&nbsp;<strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.5</label><input id='fbo-907991-4' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='4' name='fbo-907991-4' type='text' size='17' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907991-4' /></span></strong>. Parents <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.6</label><input id='fbo-907991-5' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='5' name='fbo-907991-5' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907991-5' /></span></strong> their children, and traditional festivals like Tet remain important. Modern life brings new opportunities, but family love and respect continue to be the foundation of Vietnamese society.</p>",
